@startuml
title Foundation - Stateful Primitives
hide empty description
state "Deadline [VALUE OBJECT]" as D {
  [*] --> ACTIVE
  ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : now >= deadline
}
state "Expiration [VALUE OBJECT]" as E {
  [*] --> VALID
  VALID --> EXPIRED_E : now >= expireAt
}
state "ExecutionContext [IMMUTABLE MODEL]" as C {
  [*] --> BUILT
  BUILT --> ENCODED : StandardContextCodec.write()
  ENCODED --> DECODED : StandardContextCodec.read()
}
note bottom
IronStrings / IronCollections / codec helpers 等为无状态门面，
不存在统一运行时状态机。
end note
@enduml
